<title>UK: UK Q1 C/A surplus 1.459 bln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Q1 C/A surplus 1.459 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics issued the following seasonally adjusted, first quarter current account data -</p>
<p>    TRADE (in million stg)     Q1	   Q4		   Q1,96</p>
<p>    Current account	  1,459	 508    (873)    -1,206</p>
<p>    Trade in goods	  -2,053    -2,616  (-2,581)   -3,727</p>
<p>    Trade in services	2,039     2,101   (1,935)    1,312</p>
<p>    Investment income	2,640     2,131  (2,587)     2,367</p>
<p>    Transfers		 -1,167    -1,108 (-1,068)    -1,158</p>
<p>    UK investment overseas -8,783    -7,452 (-8,156)  -10,558</p>
<p>    Overseas investment     8,700     4,545  (6,230)    4,826</p>
<p>NOTE - Market forecast Q1 c/a surplus of 500 million stg, and trade in goods deficit of 2.6 billion stg.</p>
</text>
